# By Train to Beijing — original story and translation by Claude (Anthropic).
# Target: HSK 3.0 level 1; focus grammar: 怎么, 哪儿, 先……再……, 坐 / 去 / 到; names N.

@meta {"title_zh": "坐火车去北京", "subtitle_zh": "奶奶一个人去看儿子", "title_en": "By Train to Beijing", "subtitle_en": "Grandma goes to see her son on her own", "author": "Text and translation by Claude (Anthropic)"}

@p intro
