> Grandma is sixty-eight this year, and she lives in Xi'an.
她|tā 的|de 儿子|érzi 在|zài 北京|Běijīng 工作|gōngzuò 。 奶奶|nǎinai 很|hěn 想|xiǎng 他|tā ， 想|xiǎng 去|qù 北京|Běijīng 看|kàn 他|tā 。
> Her son works in Beijing. Grandma misses him a lot and wants to go to Beijing to see him.

@p intro-2
